      "writtenOn": "2025-06-25T21:49:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`try_verify_in_tasklet` was actually added in version 1.9.0 of the verity target.\n\nHowever, the changes that improved the implementation of `try_verify_in_tasklet` were submitted only recently.  I don\u0027t think it makes sense to default it to enabled without those changes.  These changes are not associated with a particular dm-verity version number; it was not incremented, and the changes were backported to `android16-6.12` too.  `uname \u003e\u003d 6.16 || uname \u003e\u003d 6.12.30` might work, though it would be a bit of a hack.\n\nBut, even with those changes, I don\u0027t think we have enough data to enable this by default yet.  Maybe you do?  While hopefully this change is always beneficial, if there\u0027s any uncertainty I\u0027m afraid it would need to be opt-in for now.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 124,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 124,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "bdaa8bad1fcc9f02fb07a2e819fb9249edbf5664",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
