      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I don\u0027t think we have enough data to enable this by default yet.\n\nAgree, I raised the same concern as well: b/421944965#comment2.\n\nPerhaps we can use `ro.vendor.*` (in vendor.img) property to enable or `ro.boot.*` property (can be set by the bootloader or kernel cmdline) to enable.\n\nNote: usually a system.img is shared across multiple devices.\n\nCC\u0027ing inseob to see if any suggestion.",
